# 🛡️ GaitSecure  
### AI-Powered Gait-Based Authentication System  

> 🔐 Secure access using unique walking patterns

---

## 🌐 Overview

**GaitSecure** is a biometric authentication system that identifies users based on their unique walking patterns using smartphone sensor data.

It leverages:
- 📱 Mobile sensor data (Accelerometer + Gyroscope)
- 🧠 Machine Learning models (SVM, Random Forest)
- ⚡ Real-time authentication via Flask API

---

## ✨ Features

- 🚶 Real-Time Gait Recording  
- 👥 Multi-User Authentication  
- 🎨 Premium UI/UX with smooth animations  
- 🧠 Advanced ML Pipeline  
- 🖥️ Flask Backend API  
- 📊 Sensor Data Validation  
- 📱 Cross-platform (React Native + Expo)  

---

## 🏗️ Architecture


Mobile App (React Native)
│
▼
Flask API Server
│
▼
ML Models (SVM / Random Forest)


---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|------|-----------|
| Mobile App | React Native, Expo |
| Backend | Flask |
| ML Models | Scikit-learn (SVM, Random Forest) |
| Sensors | Accelerometer, Gyroscope |

